  tags: [spec, implemented]
- Pressing / on an interactive dashboard opens a filter bar that live-filters items across all panels by case-insensitive AND of whitespace-separated terms; Escape clears the filter and closes the bar, Enter jumps to the first visible match, panels with no matches are dimmed, and keyboard item navigation skips filtered-out items. Progressive enhancement only: static exports and no-JS browsers are unaffected. @spec @rendering @item-filter @implemented

