# rendering
- The Dashboard is fully server-rendered HTML with no client-side JavaScript; it works in any browser, including on mobile, and updates require a page reload or explicit refresh
- label: LayoutNodeConfig is a union of five variants: FlexContainerConfig, PanelConfig, ImageWidgetConfig, TextWidgetConfig, and IframeWidgetConfig; each discriminated by a unique key (direction+children, panel, image, text, iframe)
  command: grep -q 'FlexContainerConfig\|PanelConfig\|ImageWidgetConfig\|TextWidgetConfig\|IframeWidgetConfig' src/layout/domain.ts && grep -q 'export type LayoutNodeConfig' src/layout/domain.ts
  tags: [implemented]
- label: layout/domain.ts exports type guard functions (isPanel, isContainer, isImageWidget, isTextWidget, isIframe) that discriminate LayoutNodeConfig variants by checking for their unique key property
