- label: text widget renders plain text, markdown (via marked), or HTML content in a flex-panel; all HTML is sanitized through a strict tag/attribute allowlist (sanitize-html) to prevent XSS; discriminated by the 'text' key
  command: test -f src/layout/text-widget.tsx && grep -q 'TextWidgetConfig' src/layout/domain.ts && grep -q 'sanitize\|renderMarkdown' src/layout/text-render.ts
  tags: [implemented]
- label: iframe widget embeds an external page with security defaults: sandbox restricts capabilities, referrerpolicy is always no-referrer, and sizing uses height > aspect_ratio > 16/9 fallback; discriminated by the 'iframe' key containing a URL
  command: test -f src/layout/iframe-widget.tsx && grep -q 'IframeWidgetConfig' src/layout/domain.ts && grep -q 'referrerpolicy' src/layout/iframe-widget.tsx
