- label: widget components include accessibility attributes: decorative images (empty alt) get aria-hidden="true", counter stat cards use raw numbers (not abbreviated) in aria-labels for screen readers, refresh buttons have aria-label="Refresh", iframe containers have role="region" with aria-label, counter panels have aria-live="polite" for dynamic updates; also image widget has aria-label on linked images with empty alt, text widget has tabindex/role="region"/aria-label on scrollable body, iframe widget sets title attribute, counter panel has role="group" and composed aria-label on stat cards
