  tags: [implemented]
- label: widget-only configs (layouts containing only image/text/iframe widgets with no panel nodes) work correctly; the scheduler handles zero-adapter configs by scheduling only the daily prune timer (no refresh cycles), collectPanels returns an empty list, and isStarted() checks pruneTimer to prevent duplicate timer leaks on repeated startScheduler calls
