- label: While hide-seen mode is on, the toolbar's hide-seen button shows a badge counting the seen items the mode currently hides, kept in step with every seen-state mutation and mirrored into the button's accessible label ("Show seen items (N hidden)"); the badge collapses when the mode is off or nothing is hidden, and is client-injected so static/no-JS pages never render it
