- label: A notify rule's optional headers map adds custom HTTP headers (auth tokens etc.) to every webhook delivery including pace notify test, merged case-insensitively over the format preset's headers with the custom value winning; config validation rejects Content-Type overrides, invalid header-name tokens, and empty or newline-carrying values, and headers never affect matching or the notified_items ledger so rotating a token never re-notifies
