- label: Pressing Shift+C on an interactive dashboard collapses every panel at once, or expands them all when every panel is already collapsed; the result persists per browser through the same localStorage collapsed-panel state as the c key, and stored ids belonging to other dashboards on the origin are preserved. Progressive enhancement only: static exports and no-JS browsers are unaffected.
