- label: The dashboard client injects an unseen-count badge into every read-tracked panel header - it shows how many of the panel's seen-keyed items are not yet marked seen, updates through the refreshAllSeenPanels funnel on every seen mutation, collapses when empty (fully read or no tracked items), and is never rendered by the server or static exports
