- label: The dashboard's browser-tab title carries the page's unread total email style ((N) pace) counting distinct unseen dedup keys so cross-panel duplicates count once, updating live through the seen-state funnel and restoring the untouched server-rendered title at zero; client-side only, so static/no-JS pages keep their normal title
