- label: The dashboard favicon is a client-injected inline SVG that gains an unread dot while any read-tracked story is unseen (same distinct-story count semantics as the tab title) and reverts to the plain icon at zero; the server never renders a favicon link, so static exports and no-JS browsers are unaffected
