- label: A notify rule with format: template delivers its own template string as the body with {{rule}}, {{matched}}, {{headline}}, and {{items}} substituted per delivery (items is the plain-text bullet list with an and-N-more overflow line); config validation requires a non-empty template exactly when format is template, rejects unknown {{placeholder}} names listing the valid set, and uniquely allows a custom Content-Type header since the user owns the body; template is presentation-only and never affects matching or the notified_items ledger
