  tags: [spec, implemented]
- label: The {{items_json_array}} template placeholder takes an optional field selection ({{items_json_array:title,url,score}}) substituting the matched items as a JSON array of objects narrowed to just the listed NotifyPayloadItem fields in the listed order (so bulky summary can be omitted); config validation rejects unknown or empty field selections naming the valid fields, bare {{items_json_array}} keeps the full shape, item_template never takes the selection form, and the selection is presentation-only so editing it never re-notifies
