- label: A notify rule with format: template may set an optional item_template string rendered once per delivered item for {{items}} (placeholders {{title}}, {{url}}, {{source}}, {{score}} empty when unscored, {{meta}}), keeping the and-N-more overflow line; config validation rejects it outside format: template, empty strings, and unknown per-item placeholders listing the valid set, and item_template is presentation-only so editing it never re-notifies
